# Planning Rules

- Use `schemas/plan.schema.yaml` and `schemas/task.schema.yaml`.
- Tasks must have: id, title, agent, dependencies, estimate (S/M/L), status.
- Order tasks by dependency before assigning.
- Save plans to `docs/plans/YYYY-MM-DD-<slug>.md`.
